{"id":"21603","t":{"th":"Duel Masters Versus Revolution Final สงครามเกมส์ไพ่ วีเอสอา ไฟนอล","ro":"Duel Masters VSRF","en":null,"na":"デュエル・マスターズVSRF"},"cover":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx21603-s6kbi2Vka82A.jpg","coverM":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx21603-s6kbi2Vka82A.jpg","color":"#50aef1","banner":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21603-g29I0Zh09Nei.jpg","fmt":"TV","status":"FINISHED","eps":51,"dur":24,"season":"SPRING","year":2016,"start":"2016-04-03","country":"JP","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy"],"score":63,"pop":737,"studio":"Ascension","desc":"This sequel of 'Duel Masters Versus Revolution' continues the chain of events after the battle between the Invaders and Revolutionary. It's also the last season and conclusion of the Versus saga in the anime.\n\nThe 'V' mark that was once on Katta Kirifuda's forehead hides a mysterious force. However, the power was sealed off.\n\nEven though the impact of removing the seal does not do much, but Hamukatsu starts to talk! Plus more hamsters that are like Hamukatsu starts to appear!\n\nThey were then told about a secret organization, the \"Rare Killers\", with the members being transfer students of the school! What is the mystery of the hamsters like Hamukatsu and who exactly are the Rare Killers?\n\nThe final battle is about to start!","descTh":"ภาคต่อของ 'Duel Masters Versus Revolution' นี้ยังคงเป็นเรื่องราวต่อเนื่องหลังการต่อสู้ระหว่าง Invaders และ Revolutionary นอกจากนี้ยังเป็นฤดูกาลสุดท้ายและบทสรุปของ Versus saga ในอนิเมะอีกด้วย\n\nเครื่องหมาย 'V' ที่ครั้งหนึ่งเคยอยู่บนหน้าผากของคัตตะ คิริฟุดะ ได้ซ่อนพลังลึกลับไว้ อย่างไรก็ตาม อำนาจถูกปิดผนึกไว้\n\nแม้ว่าผลของการถอดซีลจะมีผลไม่มากนัก แต่ฮามากัตสึก็เริ่มพูด! แถมยังมีหนูแฮมสเตอร์ที่เหมือนฮามุคัตสึเริ่มปรากฏตัวอีกเพียบ!\n\nจากนั้นพวกเขาก็ได้รับการบอกเล่าเกี่ยวกับองค์กรลับ \"Rare Killers\" โดยที่สมาชิกกำลังย้ายนักเรียนของโรงเรียน! อะไรคือความลึกลับของแฮมสเตอร์อย่างฮามูคัตสึ และใครคือนักฆ่าหายากกันแน่?\n\nการต่อสู้ครั้งสุดท้ายกำลังจะเริ่มต้นขึ้นแล้ว!","src":{"meta":"anilist","th":"licensor","descTh":"gtranslate"},"trailer":"rIdLEifn894","al":"https://anilist.co/anime/21603","mal":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/32582","jp":null,"sched":[],"prov":[{"p":"bilibili","r":"TH","u":"https://www.bilibili.tv/th/play/35076","lang":"sub","eps":[["1","https://www.bilibili.tv/th/play/35076/351020",1606819260,"x","b:m201023a21rw6m374opdgf3rz2hep1ib.jpg",null,{}],["2","https://www.bilibili.tv/th/play/35076/351027",1606810380,"x","b:m201023a2bj7ft2fodaz12dem29qd1ol.jpg",null,{}],["3","https://www.bilibili.tv/th/play/35076/351017",1606810380,"x","b:m201023a22wqux3es340eqa6cwgu87bv.jpg",null,{}],["4","https://www.bilibili.tv/th/play/35076/351007",1606810380,"x","b:m201023a21omu1joudg7qs13w35obtq0.jpg",null,{}],["5","https://www.bilibili.tv/th/play/35076/350995",1606810380,"x","b:m201023a216xo4z9g6aq7a26zih92c95.jpg",null,{}],["6","https://www.bilibili.tv/th/play/35076/351021",1606810380,"x","b:m201023a22fyhnpmaima8n3deh2aasqv.jpg",null,{}],["7","https://www.bilibili.tv/th/play/35076/350992",1606810380,"x","b:m201023a21m0mi2luv9o0bbufxkpac4i.jpg",null,{}],["8","https://www.bilibili.tv/th/play/35076/351029",1606810380,"x","b:m201023a23dtkdkx8oveu32oqxm8qtuo.jpg",null,{}],["9","https://www.bilibili.tv/th/play/35076/350997",1606810380,"x","b:m201023a23ozeg170o8os7qytrpvkndn.jpg",null,{}],["10","https://www.bilibili.tv/th/play/35076/351000",1606810380,"x","b:m201023a22zriritcjvutiimi6uy08m7.jpg",null,{}],["11","https://www.bilibili.tv/th/play/35076/351016",1606810380,"x","b:m201023a210w0hvprqy5k3kjvh2oo4d8.jpg",null,{}],["12","https://www.bilibili.tv/th/play/35076/351004",1606810380,"x","b:m201023a22l8waw7txs8ba2chhnxet7m.jpg",null,{}],["13","https://www.bilibili.tv/th/play/35076/351012",1606810380,"x","b:m201023a21x5hutqz3lpy2gquow6zsyt.jpg",null,{}],["14","https://www.bilibili.tv/th/play/35076/350982",1606810380,"x","b:m201023a2k54e993almo2ecsmjhy14do.j